1
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:52,840
Still on a business trip, huh?

2
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,439
Distance means nothing.

3
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:55,680
If we need to meet,

4
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:57,319
I can be right in front of you tomorrow.

5
00:01:57,519 --> 00:01:59,480
So, did you get what I asked for?

6
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:00,959
It's really not that I won't look.

7
00:02:01,079 --> 00:02:02,480
I've put in all the work I can.

8
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:03,719
It's just very difficult.

9
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,280
If I were your boss,

10
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:06,560
I'd make you resign on the spot.

11
00:02:06,799 --> 00:02:08,280
How many times have I told you?

12
00:02:08,439 --> 00:02:09,960
If your direction is wrong, everything is wrong.

13
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,120
Why do you never listen?

14
00:02:11,199 --> 00:02:12,680
You told me to get you something,

15
00:02:12,759 --> 00:02:13,680
which means going after people.

16
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:15,240
So how do you expect me to do it?

17
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:17,520
Asking a scientist for data

18
00:02:17,599 --> 00:02:19,800
is like asking Chen Shui-bian to give up his official post.

19
00:02:19,879 --> 00:02:20,639
Top-secret data...

20
00:02:20,639 --> 00:02:22,199
that's like an engineer's eyeballs.

21
00:02:22,319 --> 00:02:24,159
You're asking them to gouge their own eyes out for you.

22
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:25,560
If that weren't hard, it'd be a miracle!

23
00:02:25,599 --> 00:02:27,199
Go check with consulting firms!

24
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:28,759
See who is working for the US government

25
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:30,080
or research institutes in Taiwan, China,

26
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,360
to draft strategic research reports.

27
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:32,759
Trace the subcontracting chain.

28
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:33,599
Understood?

29
00:02:33,639 --> 00:02:34,439
Keep going.

30
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,680
By the time it goes back to your top brass,

31
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:38,879
it's a top-secret document.

32
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,639
No matter how classified the government considers it,

33
00:02:40,639 --> 00:02:42,800
at a consulting firm, it's just tossed aside.

34
00:02:43,479 --> 00:02:45,319
Once you obtain that tech intelligence,

35
00:02:45,319 --> 00:02:46,879
then come back and trade for what you want.

36
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:48,800
Mr. Zhu said

37
00:02:49,039 --> 00:02:50,439
he really wants to hear your guidance in person,

38
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:52,120
the kind that turns iron into gold.

39
00:02:52,439 --> 00:02:53,759
He asked me to make sure to tell you,

40
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:56,039
and that he is sincerely waiting to meet you.

41
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,199
We will meet.

42
00:02:57,319 --> 00:02:58,120
Just wait a bit longer.

43
00:02:58,439 --> 00:02:59,599
When the time is right.

44
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,080
He Chunxiao!

45
00:03:35,479 --> 00:03:36,360
He Chunxiao!

46
00:03:36,719 --> 00:03:37,560
What's wrong?

47
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:41,560
The password's cracked!

48
00:03:46,199 --> 00:03:46,800
Hurry!

49
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:51,719
Director Wei!

50
00:03:51,719 --> 00:03:53,120
Jinlan guessed the password!

51
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,159
I forgot.

52
00:03:56,159 --> 00:03:58,919
I forgot what password I just typed in.

53
00:03:59,039 --> 00:04:00,560
She... She seems to have forgotten it.

54
00:04:01,199 --> 00:04:01,960
It's okay, it's okay.

55
00:04:02,159 --> 00:04:03,319
Don't panic, take it easy.

56
00:04:03,319 --> 00:04:04,120
Look.

57
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:06,000
Let's copy the files out first.

58
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:10,960
I've been trying every day,

59
00:04:11,039 --> 00:04:12,319
hundreds of combinations.

60
00:04:12,319 --> 00:04:14,159
My brain is totally numb.

61
00:04:14,159 --> 00:04:14,680
It's fine, it's fine.

62
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:15,520
If we figure out the password,

63
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,839
that data card you copied,

64
00:04:16,839 --> 00:04:17,920
we can probably crack that too.

65
00:04:18,319 --> 00:04:19,439
The pattern is bound to be the same.

66
00:04:20,519 --> 00:04:22,120
This email says

67
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:25,240
Taiwan, China's focus right now is turning assets.

68
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:27,519
It also mentions the Three Sparrows.

69
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,920
What Three Sparrows?

70
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:53,000
Professor Pan.

71
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:53,600
Good morning.

72
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:57,040
Hello, Professor Pan.

73
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:59,000
I'm with the Hong Kong Peace Foundation's media outlet,

74
00:04:59,000 --> 00:04:59,879
a reporter based on the mainland.

75
00:04:59,879 --> 00:05:00,519
My last name is Yang.

76
00:05:00,519 --> 00:05:02,639
I was wondering if you might have time for an interview.

77
00:05:02,759 --> 00:05:04,480
Sorry, I really don't have the time lately.

78
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:05,120
Maybe next time.

79
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,519
Professor Pan, our outlet

80
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,160
is every bit as good as The Strait Weekly.

81
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,480
Please give us a chance.

82
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:10,800
Just one hour is all we need, Professor Pan.

83
00:05:11,199 --> 00:05:13,399
I'm not being picky, young man.

84
00:05:13,399 --> 00:05:15,800
An interview must have substance.

85
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,639
I've already said all I need to say.

86
00:05:17,639 --> 00:05:19,120
Anything more would just be talking in circles.

87
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:21,680
That'd be disrespectful to you and your outlet.

88
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:23,120
You know what I mean.

89
00:05:25,639 --> 00:05:26,839
Excuse me. Sorry.

90
00:05:41,160 --> 00:05:41,759
Comrades,

91
00:05:41,959 --> 00:05:45,240
the international situation is complex and volatile.

92
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:47,920
In the aerospace sector,

93
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:50,000
a core strategic industry of our nation,

94
00:05:50,279 --> 00:05:51,759
technical confidentiality

95
00:05:51,759 --> 00:05:55,199
directly impacts national security and interests.

96
00:05:55,879 --> 00:05:57,160
This meeting

97
00:05:57,160 --> 00:06:00,560
aims to convey higher directives on secrecy,

98
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:03,600
review recent internal security checks,

99
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:04,759
address the problems found,

100
00:06:04,759 --> 00:06:08,319
clarify security requirements for the next phase,

101
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:10,360
fortify our technical confidentiality defenses,

102
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:13,399
and ensure model development, testing,

103
00:06:13,439 --> 00:06:16,000
and other core tasks proceed smoothly.

104
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:17,160
Comrades,

105
00:06:17,199 --> 00:06:19,600
key personnel in crucial positions

106
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:21,160
must remain especially alert

107
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:23,240
and keep national security top of mind.

108
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:24,839
Never assume

109
00:06:25,199 --> 00:06:27,759
that those harsh, painful lessons

110
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,199
are far removed from us.

111
00:06:29,399 --> 00:06:31,680
Right here, not long ago,

112
00:06:32,279 --> 00:06:34,680
we briefed on a professor from Institute 761.

113
00:06:34,759 --> 00:06:36,759
During his overseas visit,

114
00:06:36,759 --> 00:06:39,480
foreign intelligence agents

115
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:42,680
lured and turned him step by step.

116
00:06:42,759 --> 00:06:44,839
He leaked state tech secrets,

117
00:06:44,959 --> 00:06:46,920
severely endangering national security.

118
00:06:47,199 --> 00:06:48,560
His fall and imprisonment

119
00:06:48,839 --> 00:06:50,519
are still fresh in our minds!

120
00:07:21,839 --> 00:07:22,360
Go, go, go!

121
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:26,120
Come on!

122
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,399
Do you even know how to play?

123
00:07:39,399 --> 00:07:39,959
What are you doing?

124
00:07:39,959 --> 00:07:40,959
Do you know how to play?

125
00:07:41,879 --> 00:07:43,040
Do you even know how to play?

126
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:43,759
All right, that's enough.

127
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:44,800
Are we still playing or what?

128
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:45,639
You guys go ahead. Go on.

129
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:46,759
Keep playing.

130
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:47,800
It's fine, it's fine.

131
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:48,360
I'm all right.

132
00:07:48,879 --> 00:07:49,600
Just not in the zone today.

133
00:07:54,839 --> 00:07:57,240
It's not like anything's on the line.

134
00:07:58,959 --> 00:08:01,360
Why go so hard? There's no need.

135
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,199
Why aren't you playing?

136
00:08:09,079 --> 00:08:10,560
My knees are shot.

137
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:13,680
Soccer is a young man's game.

138
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,600
Didn't make the most of it when young,

139
00:08:15,639 --> 00:08:17,680
and now it's too late.

140
00:08:19,279 --> 00:08:20,319
I'm too junior.

141
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,000
With that stuff,

142
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:23,720
there's really nothing I can do.

143
00:08:26,319 --> 00:08:27,600
In three months,

144
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:30,000
you'll be fast-tracked to deputy section chief.

145
00:08:31,639 --> 00:08:32,600
When that time comes,

146
00:08:33,519 --> 00:08:34,759
you'll have a way.

147
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:42,360
Don't worry about all the gossip.

148
00:08:42,679 --> 00:08:45,000
This world isn't fair to begin with.

149
00:08:45,279 --> 00:08:46,919
People in state-owned enterprises know that best.

150
00:08:51,639 --> 00:08:52,919
What do you feel like for lunch?

151
00:08:52,919 --> 00:08:53,799
We can talk over food.

152
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:56,159
Something urgent came up at work.

153
00:08:56,399 --> 00:08:57,080
Brother,

154
00:08:57,279 --> 00:08:57,960
next time.

155
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:00,320
Great shot! Great shot! Great shot!

156
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:00,799
Great shot!

157
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:37,120
Xie Xiaozhou.

158
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:41,320
You arrived yesterday,

159
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,919
why didn't you tell me sooner?

160
00:09:42,919 --> 00:09:44,679
All right, all right, all right.

161
00:09:44,679 --> 00:09:45,639
Let me look at you.

162
00:09:47,159 --> 00:09:48,120
You've lost weight.

163
00:09:48,879 --> 00:09:49,919
How did you lose so much?

164
00:09:49,919 --> 00:09:50,799
From missing you.

165
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:53,159
This is for you.

166
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:56,279
Not bad!

167
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:58,000
I love it. Let's go.

168
00:09:58,960 --> 00:09:59,440
By the way,

169
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:01,559
my dad has a classmate at your graduate school.

170
00:10:01,559 --> 00:10:02,960
I'll take you to meet him tomorrow.

171
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:04,879
You can go to him if you ever need anything.

172
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:06,600
If you're coming to Xiamen with me,

173
00:10:07,279 --> 00:10:08,399
what about your job?

174
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:10,200
I don't care.

175
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:12,240
Wherever you are, that's where I'll go.

176
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,039
That lousy job...

177
00:10:13,039 --> 00:10:15,000
One more second there would suffocate me.

178
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:15,960
They might control promotions,

179
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,000
but they can't stop me from taking time off.

180
00:10:17,279 --> 00:10:18,120
Stay here,

181
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:20,039
finish your master's, and then get your doctorate.

182
00:10:20,039 --> 00:10:20,840
Don't leave again.

183
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,240
I really thought

184
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:26,440
I wouldn't see you until New Year's.

185
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:27,159
Yeah.

186
00:10:27,399 --> 00:10:29,080
I didn't expect you to be back so soon either.

187
00:10:30,399 --> 00:10:32,200
Why was the notice so sudden this time, anyway?

188
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:34,759
He said I could join the class,

189
00:10:34,759 --> 00:10:35,919
but had to report immediately.

190
00:10:35,919 --> 00:10:37,799
So I booked a flight right away and came back.

191
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:38,919
"He"?

192
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,159
Lin Kanshan.

193
00:10:42,039 --> 00:10:42,879
He didn't tell you?

194
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:55,200
When I first started working here,

195
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:57,000
every time I came to see the boss,

196
00:10:57,559 --> 00:10:59,519
Old Wu would make tea for me.

197
00:10:59,519 --> 00:11:00,600
I wanted to make a good impression,

198
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:01,720
but I couldn't even beat him to it.

199
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:03,519
I thought to myself,

200
00:11:03,919 --> 00:11:05,000
"He's so polite.

201
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:07,039
When will he treat me like an insider,

202
00:11:07,039 --> 00:11:08,120
like a brother?"

203
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:09,840
Then one day,

204
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:12,240
he stopped making tea for me.

205
00:11:13,399 --> 00:11:14,440
"Great!" I thought.

206
00:11:14,799 --> 00:11:16,200
I quickly stepped up to make it.

207
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:18,600
Then I asked around later,

208
00:11:18,919 --> 00:11:19,679
and I was dumbfounded.

209
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:23,120
Him making tea for you is a good thing.

210
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:24,759
When he's mad, he stops making it.

211
00:11:25,320 --> 00:11:27,679
He didn't get the intel he needed,

212
00:11:28,159 --> 00:11:29,480
so the old man got angry.

213
00:11:35,399 --> 00:11:36,279
How are things?

214
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:40,000
Is Xie Fengshi still serving tea to Lin Kanshan?

215
00:11:41,039 --> 00:11:43,080
The two haven't had much contact lately.

216
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:44,200
The intel that Jinlan gathered

217
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:45,960
from Qiu Tian says the same.

218
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:47,679
Lin Kanshan bought new soccer cleats.

219
00:11:47,799 --> 00:11:49,039
He's been obsessed with playing soccer recently.

220
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:53,799
Not even forty,

221
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:56,360
and he's already focusing on health and fitness.

222
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:57,080
Isn't that just because

223
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:59,120
there's someone on the field he's interested in?

224
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:00,720
Also,

225
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:02,399
Xiao Zhou from Institute 762

226
00:12:02,399 --> 00:12:04,720
was put on our division's watch list recently.

227
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:07,080
His girlfriend from Taiwan, China, is coming today too.

228
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:10,759
He keeps failing to score.

229
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:12,320
He's setting up an assist.

230
00:12:13,559 --> 00:12:16,360
With the vote coming up, Chen Shui-bian is getting anxious.

231
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:17,840
Between playing soccer

232
00:12:17,919 --> 00:12:19,759
and visiting Xie Fengshi for tea,

233
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:22,200
Lin Kanshan has been getting busier and busier.

234
00:12:24,639 --> 00:12:26,679
Out of the Three Sparrows,

235
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:28,799
this only accounts for two at most.

236
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:32,440
Where is the last one?

237
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:44,720
Did the hot water run out?

238
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:50,320
As for me, I didn't want to stay at home,

239
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:51,879
so near my workplace,

240
00:13:51,879 --> 00:13:53,559
I rented a place like this.

241
00:13:53,559 --> 00:13:54,679
The conditions are pretty rough.

242
00:13:54,679 --> 00:13:56,879
The water never gets warm enough.

243
00:13:58,960 --> 00:14:00,720
Just say whatever you want to say.

244
00:14:03,879 --> 00:14:05,240
For someone like me...

245
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:09,559
making you come all this way

246
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:11,120
isn't worth it.

247
00:14:12,159 --> 00:14:13,080
And what else?

248
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:16,360
What I mean is,

249
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:19,480
you can just tell me directly what you want.

250
00:14:19,759 --> 00:14:21,120
A phone call would do.

251
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:22,120
There's no need to beat around the bush.

252
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:23,039
It's too much trouble.

253
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:33,399
From the first day I emailed the school,

254
00:14:33,399 --> 00:14:34,679
to preparing the materials,

255
00:14:34,679 --> 00:14:36,919
everything of mine is right here.

256
00:14:36,919 --> 00:14:38,039
If I didn't want to come,

257
00:14:38,159 --> 00:14:39,639
no one could force me.

258
00:14:44,519 --> 00:14:46,120
I didn't have to come here at all.

259
00:14:46,639 --> 00:14:48,799
The admission process was troublesome.

260
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:51,960
You were the one who said your mother could help.

261
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:53,639
But she didn't want to.

262
00:14:53,639 --> 00:14:55,519
And my application got stuck at the school.

263
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:58,360
So I had no choice but to turn to Lin Kanshan.

264
00:14:58,360 --> 00:15:00,120
Why would Lin Kanshan help me?

265
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:01,759
Because I promised him.

266
00:15:02,279 --> 00:15:04,320
I promised him I'd convince you

267
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:06,000
to do things for him.

268
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:07,320
But I couldn't care less

269
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:08,919
whether you really help him,

270
00:15:08,919 --> 00:15:10,960
or if you're actually going to help him.

271
00:15:14,840 --> 00:15:16,360
All I wanted was to come to Minzhong.

272
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:18,879
No,

273
00:15:18,879 --> 00:15:20,519
that's not what I meant.

274
00:15:20,519 --> 00:15:21,120
I'm just worried about you...

275
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:22,039
I'm not afraid.

276
00:15:24,159 --> 00:15:26,759
I came all the way here from Europe alone.

277
00:15:26,759 --> 00:15:28,279
As long as I can see you,

278
00:15:29,039 --> 00:15:30,480
I'm not afraid of anything.

279
00:15:47,279 --> 00:15:48,320
The feng shui master is here.

280
00:15:48,519 --> 00:15:50,840
He says your office layout is generally fine.

281
00:15:50,919 --> 00:15:51,879
Just needs minor adjustments.

282
00:15:52,279 --> 00:15:53,240
Coming back to take a look?

283
00:15:53,240 --> 00:15:55,000
Crystals go in the Dui position.

284
00:15:55,360 --> 00:15:55,840
Move it further.

285
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:57,399
Turn it... Just a little bit.

286
00:15:57,399 --> 00:15:58,360
Good, good, good.

287
00:15:58,360 --> 00:15:59,279
That's it, that's fine.

288
00:15:59,399 --> 00:16:01,000
The Kun and Li positions...

289
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:02,360
...are for the Qilin.

290
00:16:02,360 --> 00:16:03,240
Put the Qilin there.

291
00:16:03,240 --> 00:16:04,919
Li brings great wealth and fortune.

292
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:06,840
Right, bring it a bit closer to me.

293
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:08,320
Have the Qilin face me.

294
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:09,039
Good, that works.

295
00:16:09,039 --> 00:16:10,080
Same with that side.

296
00:16:13,399 --> 00:16:14,360
Great, now it's symmetrical.

297
00:16:19,240 --> 00:16:21,399
Gen is an extremely ominous position.

298
00:16:21,639 --> 00:16:23,399
It ruins your financial luck.

299
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:25,720
This safe can't stay here anymore.

300
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:27,120
This is an ominous spot.

301
00:16:27,200 --> 00:16:28,080
Where should it go then?

302
00:16:28,360 --> 00:16:29,360
The Zhen position.

303
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:31,720
The Zhen position is highly auspicious.

304
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:33,360
The Zhen position. Over here.

305
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:34,360
Move it over.

306
00:16:35,039 --> 00:16:35,799
But won't that...

307
00:16:35,799 --> 00:16:37,440
Won't it get in your way when walking by?

308
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:38,799
It doesn't matter.

309
00:16:38,799 --> 00:16:39,960
Making money comes first.

310
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:40,960
Hurry, move it over.

311
00:16:41,679 --> 00:16:42,720
Won't it block the way?

312
00:16:42,720 --> 00:16:44,120
Not at all, not at all.

313
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:46,080
Come on, move it right here.

314
00:16:46,679 --> 00:16:47,519
This is so heavy.

315
00:16:47,519 --> 00:16:49,240
Should we get movers to carry it?

316
00:16:49,399 --> 00:16:50,440
Why get movers?

317
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:51,320
They're clumsy.

318
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:52,679
Nobody else should touch the safe.

319
00:16:52,679 --> 00:16:53,600
I'll do it. Let me.

320
00:16:53,600 --> 00:16:54,919
Clear the stuff off the top.

321
00:16:55,799 --> 00:16:56,600
Take it easy.

322
00:17:03,039 --> 00:17:04,359
It really is pretty heavy.

323
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:08,519
Come on.

324
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:10,920
Looks great!

325
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:38,839
Tomorrow at 10:30 AM,

326
00:17:38,839 --> 00:17:40,799
my office is sending me to group headquarters

327
00:17:40,799 --> 00:17:42,000
to deliver some documents.

328
00:17:42,079 --> 00:17:44,200
They'll definitely arrange a secure courier car.

329
00:17:44,200 --> 00:17:45,200
If you want to see them,

330
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:46,680
figure it out yourself.

331
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:03,079
Whatever you do,

332
00:18:03,079 --> 00:18:04,799
always prepare for the worst.

333
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,440
Never rely on luck.

334
00:18:06,559 --> 00:18:08,759
The moment a bug might be compromised,

335
00:18:08,759 --> 00:18:10,559
assume it already is.

336
00:18:10,559 --> 00:18:12,079
Whatever you do, don't touch it again.

337
00:18:12,079 --> 00:18:13,519
Just act like you know nothing.

338
00:18:13,519 --> 00:18:15,160
Brainwash yourself over and over:

339
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:17,519
you don't know there's a bug in this room,

340
00:18:17,720 --> 00:18:18,960
you have nothing to do with it,

341
00:18:19,119 --> 00:18:20,119
and you've never seen it before.

342
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:50,559
I think I left my car keys in the car.

343
00:18:50,559 --> 00:18:52,000
Don't tell me you didn't even shut the door.

344
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:53,160
Why don't you go check?

345
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:54,359
Okay.

346
00:19:47,200 --> 00:19:48,880
About our real estate project,

347
00:19:48,880 --> 00:19:50,440
we have a pricing meeting tomorrow.

348
00:19:50,599 --> 00:19:52,319
Shouldn't we touch base in advance?

349
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:53,680
All right.

350
00:19:54,559 --> 00:19:56,039
Eight tonight, then.

351
00:19:56,039 --> 00:19:56,920
The usual place.

352
00:19:56,920 --> 00:19:58,279
I'll let everyone know.

353
00:19:58,400 --> 00:19:59,240
See you tonight.

354
00:20:14,519 --> 00:20:16,759
At 8:00 tonight, the neighbor is meeting someone.

355
00:20:16,759 --> 00:20:18,079
We don't know who specifically.

356
00:20:18,079 --> 00:20:19,279
We don't know what it's about.

357
00:20:19,279 --> 00:20:20,680
We don't know the location yet either.

358
00:20:20,680 --> 00:20:21,759
Do you want to check it out?

359
00:20:21,759 --> 00:20:22,480
Got it.

360
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:24,480
I'll head to his company now to keep an eye on him.

361
00:20:48,240 --> 00:20:49,000
Welcome.

362
00:20:52,200 --> 00:20:53,000
Hello.

363
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:53,720
I need to use the phone.

364
00:20:53,720 --> 00:20:54,920
Sure, sir. Go right ahead.

365
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:05,079
Mr. Zhu, it's me.

366
00:21:05,319 --> 00:21:06,799
I lost my phone.

367
00:21:06,960 --> 00:21:08,240
No idea who stole it.

368
00:21:08,359 --> 00:21:09,319
I'm guessing

369
00:21:10,720 --> 00:21:12,279
it might be an inside job.

370
00:21:34,480 --> 00:21:35,200
Mr. Zhu.

371
00:21:36,720 --> 00:21:37,720
Understood.

372
00:21:37,720 --> 00:21:38,680
What do you want me to do?

373
00:21:43,319 --> 00:21:43,880
Got it.

374
00:21:52,759 --> 00:21:53,440
What's wrong?

375
00:21:54,480 --> 00:21:56,079
That massage chair of yours...

376
00:21:56,079 --> 00:21:57,359
Can you get someone to adjust it?

377
00:21:57,359 --> 00:21:59,880
Every time, it feels like I've been beaten up.

378
00:21:59,880 --> 00:22:01,640
My back hurts even worse than before.

379
00:22:03,359 --> 00:22:05,839
Two bank loans are due this month.

380
00:22:05,839 --> 00:22:06,880
The private room renovations,

381
00:22:06,880 --> 00:22:08,960
and the payment for the sound system are due too.

382
00:22:09,119 --> 00:22:11,079
None of these payments can be delayed any longer.

383
00:22:11,680 --> 00:22:13,960
The workers stopped for half a day this morning.

384
00:22:13,960 --> 00:22:14,519
So,

385
00:22:14,519 --> 00:22:16,640
the reopening has to be pushed back two weeks.

386
00:22:16,640 --> 00:22:18,519
Only if we keep my promise to them

387
00:22:18,519 --> 00:22:21,880
to settle all back pay within three days.

388
00:22:24,359 --> 00:22:25,440
What's this?

389
00:22:25,759 --> 00:22:27,319
A lawyer's letter.

390
00:22:27,680 --> 00:22:29,960
Your wife had someone send it over.

391
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:31,759
Just give her a call.

392
00:22:31,799 --> 00:22:34,160
Tell her the child support for our second kid

393
00:22:34,160 --> 00:22:36,599
will be wired to her account early next month.

394
00:22:37,000 --> 00:22:38,599
Just tell her I went abroad.

395
00:22:40,400 --> 00:22:41,279
And one more thing.

396
00:22:41,279 --> 00:22:42,799
About those shares in the shoe factory,

397
00:22:42,799 --> 00:22:44,960
that buyer from Guangzhou is still interested,

398
00:22:44,960 --> 00:22:46,359
but he keeps driving down the price.

399
00:22:46,359 --> 00:22:47,599
Why don't we wait a bit longer?

400
00:22:47,599 --> 00:22:49,319
The more rushed you look, the harder he haggles.

401
00:22:51,880 --> 00:22:52,960
Handle it as you see fit.

402
00:22:53,119 --> 00:22:55,839
Either way, reopening cannot be delayed any more.

403
00:22:56,079 --> 00:22:57,160
Any longer,

404
00:22:57,160 --> 00:22:59,400
and our cash flow will completely break.

405
00:23:00,160 --> 00:23:03,079
I have to go bowling with Boss Yao now.

406
00:23:14,200 --> 00:23:14,839
Brother,

407
00:23:17,839 --> 00:23:20,200
how is the inside man doing?

408
00:23:20,880 --> 00:23:22,799
I was going to tell you over the phone,

409
00:23:22,799 --> 00:23:25,319
but I figured it was better in person.

410
00:23:25,839 --> 00:23:27,960
The situation has changed a bit.

411
00:23:28,960 --> 00:23:29,960
As for the holdouts refusing demolition,

412
00:23:29,960 --> 00:23:31,279
there are eight households now.

413
00:23:31,480 --> 00:23:32,759
The key is,

414
00:23:32,759 --> 00:23:34,599
the lead holdout...

415
00:23:34,920 --> 00:23:37,119
he's asking for this much now.

416
00:23:39,279 --> 00:23:41,480
The guy I brought in is his brother-in-law.

417
00:23:41,480 --> 00:23:43,079
Once the price is mostly settled,

418
00:23:43,079 --> 00:23:44,799
he'll stir up a fight.

419
00:23:44,799 --> 00:23:46,000
Once they're divided from within,

420
00:23:46,000 --> 00:23:47,400
things will be easy to handle.

421
00:23:49,680 --> 00:23:52,200
I used to think attracting investment was the hardest job.

422
00:23:52,200 --> 00:23:54,240
I never expected demolition to be even harder.

423
00:23:55,240 --> 00:23:56,599
How about that hotel you wanted to invest in?

424
00:23:56,599 --> 00:23:57,799
How did the talks go?

425
00:23:58,599 --> 00:23:59,920
The big boss has changed.

426
00:24:01,160 --> 00:24:01,960
Who is it?

427
00:24:02,319 --> 00:24:03,160
Wen Zongshu.

428
00:24:03,160 --> 00:24:03,920
Him?

429
00:24:04,680 --> 00:24:06,880
He might go bankrupt tonight.

430
00:24:07,960 --> 00:24:08,920
So it's you now?

431
00:24:09,599 --> 00:24:11,599
I'm just a minor shareholder.

432
00:24:11,599 --> 00:24:12,759
Just like your brother-in-law.

433
00:24:13,240 --> 00:24:15,759
I put today's meeting together at the last minute.

434
00:24:16,240 --> 00:24:17,759
I didn't notify He Chunxiao.

435
00:24:17,759 --> 00:24:20,400
He has a sharp business instinct now.

436
00:24:20,599 --> 00:24:22,119
Do you think he'll show up?

437
00:24:22,119 --> 00:24:24,119
Why would he come to a meeting like this?

438
00:24:24,599 --> 00:24:25,599
Let's head inside first.

439
00:24:27,720 --> 00:24:29,400
Director Wu, I've been waiting for you!

440
00:24:35,119 --> 00:24:37,200
If He Chunxiao shows up here,

441
00:24:37,880 --> 00:24:39,279
it proves that he and Qiu Tian,

442
00:24:39,920 --> 00:24:40,799
along with Jinlan,

443
00:24:41,279 --> 00:24:43,119
are in cahoots.

444
00:24:43,880 --> 00:24:46,279
That loosened bug in the office...

445
00:24:47,039 --> 00:24:48,200
could he have planted it?

446
00:24:48,559 --> 00:24:50,519
What's his connection to Qiu Tian?

447
00:24:51,079 --> 00:24:53,400
Or could it not be Qiu Tian?

448
00:24:53,440 --> 00:24:54,480
Welcome.

449
00:25:09,160 --> 00:25:10,960
If there's any chance the bug might be compromised,

450
00:25:10,960 --> 00:25:12,920
you must assume it already has been.

451
00:25:13,400 --> 00:25:15,480
Notify me via the emergency channel as soon as possible.

452
00:25:15,759 --> 00:25:16,680
The sooner, the better.

453
00:25:30,960 --> 00:25:31,960
The bug has been compromised.

454
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:34,759
Tonight's meeting could be a trap to test you,

455
00:25:34,759 --> 00:25:36,279
and to test Qiu Tian.

456
00:25:46,680 --> 00:25:48,079
Among the materials you gave me earlier,

457
00:25:48,079 --> 00:25:49,000
there's an issue with one of them.

458
00:25:49,680 --> 00:25:51,359
Are you free? Let's meet up and talk.

459
00:25:51,359 --> 00:25:52,400
I'm not in Minzhong right now.

460
00:25:52,640 --> 00:25:53,440
What's the issue?

461
00:25:53,440 --> 00:25:54,759
Arriving at Jinding Square.

462
00:25:54,920 --> 00:25:56,519
Passengers getting off, please exit.

463
00:25:56,759 --> 00:25:58,799
You won't lose any money, Brother Qi.

464
00:25:58,799 --> 00:25:59,759
It'll only take a minute to verify.

465
00:26:00,480 --> 00:26:02,000
How about I meet you at Jinding Square?

466
00:26:02,359 --> 00:26:03,279
I'm tied up right now.

467
00:26:03,799 --> 00:26:04,599
Let's talk later.

468
00:26:05,319 --> 00:26:06,160
You decide, then.

469
00:26:07,920 --> 00:26:08,799
Let's talk tonight.

470
00:26:09,440 --> 00:26:10,480
You can pick the place, too.

471
00:26:10,920 --> 00:26:12,720
How about this? I'll call you at eight tonight.

472
00:26:13,319 --> 00:26:13,759
All right.

473
00:26:30,079 --> 00:26:31,039
Come on, pick up!

474
00:26:33,359 --> 00:26:34,680
I found my phone.

475
00:26:35,119 --> 00:26:36,599
She's not the thief.

476
00:26:37,519 --> 00:26:38,799
It's already too late.

477
00:26:39,359 --> 00:26:40,680
What do you mean it's too late?

478
00:28:15,640 --> 00:28:16,559
Mission aborted.

479
00:28:17,359 --> 00:28:19,039
The government's stance is very simple.

480
00:28:19,400 --> 00:28:20,920
Housing prices must stay stable.

481
00:28:20,920 --> 00:28:23,000
We must respect market regulations.

482
00:28:23,000 --> 00:28:25,279
You've already received discounts on the land,

483
00:28:25,279 --> 00:28:27,000
so you must give back to the market.

484
00:28:27,000 --> 00:28:28,720
The public deserves real benefits.

485
00:28:32,680 --> 00:28:33,759
Have the car pulled up downstairs.

486
00:28:33,759 --> 00:28:34,559
I'm coming down right now.

487
00:28:34,880 --> 00:28:35,400
Okay.

488
00:28:36,759 --> 00:28:38,359
We each have our own roles.

489
00:28:38,519 --> 00:28:40,160
Let's each handle our own part.

490
00:28:40,359 --> 00:28:41,759
I'll manage the demolitions,

491
00:28:41,920 --> 00:28:43,279
you build the houses properly,

492
00:28:43,279 --> 00:28:44,359
and set reasonable prices.

493
00:28:44,359 --> 00:28:46,319
Good for you, good for me, good for the people.

494
00:28:46,599 --> 00:28:48,240
We appreciate the leadership,

495
00:28:48,240 --> 00:28:49,519
we appreciate the government,

496
00:28:49,519 --> 00:28:51,119
and everything gets even better.

497
00:28:51,119 --> 00:28:51,839
Sound good?

498
00:28:53,480 --> 00:28:54,200
Sounds great.

499
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:55,359
No need to see me off.

500
00:28:55,359 --> 00:28:56,240
Please, don't see me out.

501
00:28:56,240 --> 00:28:56,839
Xiao Lin, don't bother.

502
00:28:56,839 --> 00:28:57,640
Sit down, please.

503
00:28:57,640 --> 00:28:58,480
All right, all right.

504
00:28:58,480 --> 00:29:00,000
Fine, fine.

505
00:29:00,160 --> 00:29:01,240
Go on with your meeting.

506
00:29:02,400 --> 00:29:03,079
Take your seats.

507
00:29:04,440 --> 00:29:05,359
Listen, everyone.

508
00:29:05,359 --> 00:29:06,400
We're all busy here.

509
00:29:06,400 --> 00:29:08,079
For the new properties launching next week,

510
00:29:08,079 --> 00:29:09,599
how exactly are we raising the prices?

511
00:29:09,720 --> 00:29:10,519
Let's hear your thoughts.

512
00:29:11,240 --> 00:29:12,160
I'll start.

513
00:29:12,160 --> 00:29:14,440
Based on prices in Xiamen and Quanzhou,

514
00:29:14,440 --> 00:29:16,160
raising it by 500 per square meter

515
00:29:16,319 --> 00:29:18,079
might be the right move.

516
00:29:18,079 --> 00:29:19,359
No way, that's too little.

517
00:29:19,400 --> 00:29:21,079
People buy when prices rise, not fall.

518
00:29:21,079 --> 00:29:22,960
Make it 1,200.

519
00:29:22,960 --> 00:29:24,200
Anyone willing to pay an extra 1,000

520
00:29:24,200 --> 00:29:26,240
won't care about another 200.

521
00:29:26,240 --> 00:29:27,079
Makes sense.

522
00:29:27,079 --> 00:29:28,119
Makes total sense.

523
00:29:28,480 --> 00:29:29,200
Let's raise it by 1,200.

524
00:29:29,200 --> 00:29:30,319
Such a big price hike,

525
00:29:30,319 --> 00:29:31,920
settled in just a few words?

526
00:29:32,319 --> 00:29:33,079
What else would we do?

527
00:29:33,079 --> 00:29:34,400
Did you expect everyone here

528
00:29:34,400 --> 00:29:35,240
to pull out an abacus

529
00:29:35,240 --> 00:29:36,400
and clatter away to calculate it?

530
00:29:37,880 --> 00:29:38,599
Who has time for that?

531
00:29:39,039 --> 00:29:40,559
This is way too casual.

532
00:29:40,559 --> 00:29:41,960
I wouldn't believe it if I hadn't had a drink.

533
00:29:42,839 --> 00:29:43,720
Boss Lin,

534
00:29:43,720 --> 00:29:44,720
you'll get used to it.

535
00:29:44,720 --> 00:29:46,200
We'll make a fortune together from now on.

536
00:29:46,880 --> 00:29:47,720
Yes, indeed.

537
00:29:47,880 --> 00:29:49,279
I've set up a meeting with Mr. Wang for you.

538
00:29:49,519 --> 00:29:50,200
Talk to him,

539
00:29:50,200 --> 00:29:51,319
and you'll have it locked down.

540
00:29:52,000 --> 00:29:52,599
Right.

541
00:29:52,599 --> 00:29:53,759
Just wait to strike it rich together.

542
00:29:53,759 --> 00:29:55,440
Can we bump up the price a bit more then?

543
00:29:55,440 --> 00:29:57,200
Let's talk through all the options first.

544
00:29:57,200 --> 00:29:58,799
Whether we can set it will depend on that.

545
00:29:58,920 --> 00:29:59,720
All right.

546
00:29:59,720 --> 00:30:00,680
Come on, cheers.

547
00:30:00,680 --> 00:30:01,240
Cheers.

548
00:30:01,240 --> 00:30:01,839
Come on, drink up.

549
00:30:01,839 --> 00:30:02,519
To making a fortune!

550
00:30:02,519 --> 00:30:03,200
To fortune!

551
00:30:06,200 --> 00:30:07,599
Among the things you handed me earlier,

552
00:30:07,599 --> 00:30:08,519
there's an issue with one of them.

553
00:30:08,880 --> 00:30:09,799
I'm tied up right now.

554
00:30:10,319 --> 00:30:11,079
Let's talk about it later.

555
00:30:11,279 --> 00:30:11,880
You decide when.

556
00:30:12,240 --> 00:30:13,400
You can pick the place, too.

557
00:30:19,960 --> 00:30:21,400
That night market by Hongqi Market,

558
00:30:21,400 --> 00:30:22,319
we can't go there anymore.

559
00:30:22,400 --> 00:30:23,480
I only had one bowl of noodles,

560
00:30:23,640 --> 00:30:24,839
and I ran to the bathroom three times.

561
00:30:25,160 --> 00:30:26,599
If you really went that many times,

562
00:30:26,599 --> 00:30:27,799
would you still have the energy to run here?

563
00:30:28,400 --> 00:30:29,000
Cut the act.

564
00:30:31,880 --> 00:30:32,720
What act did I put on?

565
00:30:32,960 --> 00:30:34,440
You wrote the whole script.

566
00:30:34,440 --> 00:30:36,119
Don't you know full well what act it was?

567
00:30:36,519 --> 00:30:37,680
You deliberately lured me here,

568
00:30:37,960 --> 00:30:38,559
to take the fall for you,

569
00:30:38,559 --> 00:30:39,559
and take a bullet for you.

570
00:30:40,000 --> 00:30:40,880
Team Leader He,

571
00:30:41,039 --> 00:30:42,559
you can't bully a veteran comrade like this.

572
00:30:43,359 --> 00:30:45,319
Nobody knows Ma Qi better than I do.

573
00:30:45,640 --> 00:30:46,680
When I ask to meet him,

574
00:30:46,759 --> 00:30:48,799
if I ask him to set the time and place,

575
00:30:48,839 --> 00:30:50,680
he'll turn around and make me decide first.

576
00:30:50,839 --> 00:30:51,599
And once I choose,

577
00:30:52,119 --> 00:30:53,119
he won't show up.

578
00:30:53,359 --> 00:30:54,319
What do you plan to do?

579
00:30:54,759 --> 00:30:56,279
No matter where the Neighbor goes tonight,

580
00:30:56,759 --> 00:30:58,759
I'll find a way to get Ma Qi there too.

581
00:30:58,839 --> 00:31:01,119
Someone who once helped Boss Lin...

582
00:31:01,440 --> 00:31:02,480
When the two meet again,

583
00:31:02,599 --> 00:31:04,240
both of them will have their suspicions.

584
00:31:04,440 --> 00:31:05,279
And those thoughts

585
00:31:05,680 --> 00:31:07,079
will offer the best protection for Qiu Tian.

586
00:31:07,359 --> 00:31:08,240
Killing two birds with one stone.

587
00:31:08,480 --> 00:31:10,200
How can you be sure Ma Qi will go?

588
00:31:10,480 --> 00:31:11,720
This is our only chance.

589
00:31:12,119 --> 00:31:13,200
We have to take a gamble.

590
00:31:13,680 --> 00:31:15,160
Don't you hate it when people say

591
00:31:15,160 --> 00:31:16,640
you're very similar to Ma Qi?

592
00:31:17,480 --> 00:31:18,880
Ma Qi loves to gamble.

593
00:31:18,880 --> 00:31:20,799
If imitating him gets the job done,

594
00:31:20,799 --> 00:31:22,079
then that works too.

595
00:31:24,240 --> 00:31:27,039
Brother Qi, I came to talk intelligence with you.

596
00:31:27,200 --> 00:31:28,519
Yet here you are, telling me stories.

597
00:31:29,839 --> 00:31:31,680
Knowing I wouldn't follow your train of thought,

598
00:31:32,119 --> 00:31:33,319
you deliberately asked me to pick a place.

599
00:31:33,920 --> 00:31:35,519
You said it once, and then repeated it.

600
00:31:36,000 --> 00:31:36,680
You gambled right,

601
00:31:36,680 --> 00:31:37,920
betting I'd go against your wishes.

602
00:31:38,160 --> 00:31:39,480
Once I told you to decide on the place,

603
00:31:40,160 --> 00:31:41,480
you brought me right here.

604
00:31:41,680 --> 00:31:43,240
You told me to meet in the courtyard,

605
00:31:43,400 --> 00:31:44,839
yet insisted on parking deep inside.

606
00:31:45,079 --> 00:31:46,200
You made me walk across the courtyard on purpose,

607
00:31:46,359 --> 00:31:47,440
playing along with your little act.

608
00:31:47,920 --> 00:31:48,920
Who is this show for?

609
00:31:50,480 --> 00:31:51,799
If you don't believe me, I'll show you.

610
00:31:52,240 --> 00:31:53,359
Don't bother pulling it out.

611
00:31:53,359 --> 00:31:54,559
It's nothing more than a cover.

612
00:31:54,920 --> 00:31:56,519
That intel was handed over to you long ago.

613
00:31:56,640 --> 00:31:58,319
Why did you only find an issue with it now?

614
00:31:58,720 --> 00:31:59,640
You know me,

615
00:31:59,640 --> 00:32:01,160
just like I know you.

616
00:32:01,400 --> 00:32:02,640
A smart guy like you—

617
00:32:02,640 --> 00:32:03,920
if there really were a problem,

618
00:32:04,000 --> 00:32:05,960
you would've come right back the second we parted.

619
00:32:06,279 --> 00:32:07,559
Why wait until now?

620
00:32:10,200 --> 00:32:12,680
If you don't believe me, there's nothing I can do.

621
00:32:14,960 --> 00:32:16,440
Having every step planned out,

622
00:32:17,079 --> 00:32:18,160
walking right into the cage,

623
00:32:18,160 --> 00:32:19,960
only to realize I'm supposed to crack your case.

624
00:32:20,720 --> 00:32:21,279
What's the point?

625
00:32:22,079 --> 00:32:23,799
Though I don't know what your plan is,

626
00:32:24,599 --> 00:32:25,519
still,

627
00:32:25,680 --> 00:32:27,480
I'm willing to let you owe me a favor.

628
00:32:28,519 --> 00:32:29,880
Let me guess.

629
00:32:30,160 --> 00:32:32,160
What kind of story are you spinning?

630
00:32:32,160 --> 00:32:34,440
What kind of role do I play in it?

631
00:32:35,160 --> 00:32:35,880
If I guess right,

632
00:32:36,480 --> 00:32:38,720
I'll know how big a favor you owe me.

633
00:32:41,440 --> 00:32:42,240
Take a guess, then.

634
00:32:43,519 --> 00:32:44,000
Forget it.

635
00:32:44,799 --> 00:32:45,559
I won't guess.

636
00:32:45,720 --> 00:32:46,720
If I guess wrong,

637
00:32:46,720 --> 00:32:47,960
what happens to my pride?

638
00:32:48,559 --> 00:32:49,839
From the moment you got in the car until now,

639
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:51,279
you've just been listening to me talk.

640
00:32:52,079 --> 00:32:53,279
You've achieved your goal, haven't you?

641
00:32:53,960 --> 00:32:54,839
I can leave now.

642
00:32:55,400 --> 00:32:56,920
Look at you, paranoid every single day.

643
00:32:57,119 --> 00:32:58,519
Here, drink this.

644
00:32:58,640 --> 00:33:00,880
Look at your bloodshot eyes. Clear your head.

645
00:33:01,359 --> 00:33:02,559
If you're not in a hurry,

646
00:33:02,599 --> 00:33:04,039
my stomach happens to be empty too.

647
00:33:04,119 --> 00:33:05,680
How about I treat you to a midnight snack?

648
00:33:07,160 --> 00:33:08,240
We'll each go home.

649
00:33:08,839 --> 00:33:09,839
Let's leave early.

650
00:33:10,519 --> 00:33:11,880
The real estate bosses

651
00:33:11,880 --> 00:33:13,720
are still holding a meeting in the building ahead.

652
00:33:13,960 --> 00:33:15,200
If we run into an acquaintance in a bit,

653
00:33:15,200 --> 00:33:16,720
we'll have to fake pleasantries with them.

654
00:33:17,039 --> 00:33:17,839
Just watch.

655
00:33:17,839 --> 00:33:19,319
Downtown house prices are going to rise again.

656
00:33:19,759 --> 00:33:21,599
Should you and Jinlan consider buying another one?

657
00:33:22,000 --> 00:33:23,279
They rise every year.

658
00:33:23,759 --> 00:33:24,799
It has to peak sometime, doesn't it?

659
00:33:26,400 --> 00:33:27,359
I believe Lin Kanshan.

660
00:33:27,599 --> 00:33:28,880
He says buy long on the upside,

661
00:33:28,880 --> 00:33:29,960
so we must bet on the rise.

662
00:34:08,760 --> 00:34:09,920
Have you been drinking?

663
00:34:10,239 --> 00:34:11,760
How much did you have?

664
00:34:12,159 --> 00:34:13,400
You've had too much.

665
00:34:13,679 --> 00:34:15,239
How much did you drink?

666
00:34:40,119 --> 00:34:41,360
What are you thinking?

667
00:34:42,960 --> 00:34:43,719
Tell me.

668
00:34:44,800 --> 00:34:46,519
What's going through your head?

669
00:35:07,239 --> 00:35:08,880
You won't betray me, will you?

670
00:35:12,760 --> 00:35:13,800
You won't hurt me either,

671
00:35:14,039 --> 00:35:15,519
and you won't lie to me, right?

672
00:35:20,440 --> 00:35:21,519
Everything you've told me...

673
00:35:22,519 --> 00:35:23,480
it's all true,

674
00:35:24,400 --> 00:35:25,199
isn't it?

675
00:35:29,480 --> 00:35:30,280
Don't lie to me.

676
00:35:33,599 --> 00:35:35,119
In a city this big,

677
00:35:36,280 --> 00:35:37,480
the only one I can trust,

678
00:35:37,719 --> 00:35:38,880
the only one I dare trust,

679
00:35:41,800 --> 00:35:43,719
is you.

680
00:35:48,079 --> 00:35:50,360
Don't lie to me, okay?

681
00:35:52,400 --> 00:35:53,760
Don't lie to me, okay?

682
00:37:01,639 --> 00:37:02,239
Professor Pan.

683
00:37:02,760 --> 00:37:04,360
My name is Yang. We've met before.

684
00:37:05,639 --> 00:37:08,119
Last time, I nearly dropped a cup on your shoes.

685
00:37:09,320 --> 00:37:10,400
Outside the school gate.

686
00:37:10,639 --> 00:37:11,039
Right.

687
00:37:11,280 --> 00:37:12,480
How did you find me here?

688
00:37:13,039 --> 00:37:15,119
Our editor-in-chief told me to keep trying.

689
00:37:15,559 --> 00:37:17,440
If you don't have time for interviews or articles,

690
00:37:17,440 --> 00:37:19,119
could you serve as our consultant?

691
00:37:19,280 --> 00:37:20,599
You can name your fee.

692
00:37:20,599 --> 00:37:21,519
I've been too busy lately.

693
00:37:21,519 --> 00:37:22,480
I can't spare the time.

694
00:37:22,639 --> 00:37:23,519
Professor Pan.

695
00:37:23,519 --> 00:37:25,639
We can also get your papers published in Hong Kong, China.

696
00:37:25,679 --> 00:37:27,000
At no cost, and very convenient.

697
00:37:27,079 --> 00:37:28,760
Thank you for the offer, but no.

698
00:37:29,280 --> 00:37:30,760
Professor Pan! Professor Pan!

699
00:37:41,320 --> 00:37:42,599
Every time there is a promotion,

700
00:37:42,920 --> 00:37:44,000
people always gossip.

701
00:37:44,320 --> 00:37:46,639
I've never stooped to their level,

702
00:37:46,639 --> 00:37:47,920
but this time is different.

703
00:37:47,920 --> 00:37:48,920
It implicates the leadership

704
00:37:48,920 --> 00:37:50,559
and harms the provincial government's reputation.

705
00:37:50,559 --> 00:37:51,599
If I don't report it,

706
00:37:51,599 --> 00:37:52,679
wouldn't that count as an admission?

707
00:37:53,280 --> 00:37:55,519
They say I became deputy head of the title committee

708
00:37:55,519 --> 00:37:57,519
because I always lecture at the provincial government.

709
00:37:58,039 --> 00:37:59,320
Breeding suspicion,

710
00:37:59,320 --> 00:38:00,280
casting malicious insinuations...

711
00:38:00,360 --> 00:38:01,920
This is outright slander!

712
00:38:01,920 --> 00:38:03,519
Will the university investigate and handle this?

713
00:38:04,039 --> 00:38:04,599
We will investigate.

714
00:38:04,800 --> 00:38:05,760
We must investigate.

715
00:38:16,079 --> 00:38:16,719
Professor Pan,

716
00:38:17,360 --> 00:38:18,960
I have an urgent matter here.

717
00:38:19,360 --> 00:38:20,599
Please take a look at this first.

718
00:38:20,960 --> 00:38:21,519
What is this?

719
00:38:22,079 --> 00:38:22,960
We'd like to ask you

720
00:38:23,079 --> 00:38:23,840
to draft a report

721
00:38:24,159 --> 00:38:27,440
analyzing provincial and coastal economic trends.

722
00:38:27,719 --> 00:38:28,599
It's very likely

723
00:38:28,760 --> 00:38:30,320
to be submitted to the Central Authorities as an internal reference report.

724
00:38:31,000 --> 00:38:33,119
I think you're the best person to write it.

725
00:38:33,519 --> 00:38:34,519
The sooner, the better.

726
00:38:35,199 --> 00:38:36,239
What about the rumors I mentioned?

727
00:38:37,000 --> 00:38:38,000
We'll investigate!

728
00:38:38,239 --> 00:38:39,159
We definitely will.

729
00:38:39,159 --> 00:38:41,039
Once found, we'll make an example of them.

730
00:38:41,480 --> 00:38:43,719
You're a shoo-in for the excellence award.

731
00:38:43,920 --> 00:38:45,360
Who else could it be?

732
00:38:51,599 --> 00:38:53,559
I trust the university will handle this impartially.

733
00:38:54,199 --> 00:38:55,159
We definitely will.

734
00:38:59,440 --> 00:38:59,920
I'm at the university.

735
00:38:59,920 --> 00:39:01,519
Nobody's around. Go ahead.

736
00:39:03,920 --> 00:39:06,159
Colon polyps? When were they found?

737
00:39:09,000 --> 00:39:10,159
What did the doctor say?

738
00:39:10,320 --> 00:39:11,360
Do you need a biopsy?

739
00:39:13,559 --> 00:39:14,920
Going to Beijing for tests...

740
00:39:14,920 --> 00:39:16,400
was that your own idea,

741
00:39:16,599 --> 00:39:17,960
or the doctor's suggestion?

742
00:39:19,440 --> 00:39:21,440
First of all, keep this confidential.

743
00:39:21,840 --> 00:39:24,000
Or who knows where rumors will spread.

744
00:39:24,360 --> 00:39:25,960
Working in the public sector, you must be extra careful.

745
00:39:26,679 --> 00:39:27,920
Listen to me first.

746
00:39:27,960 --> 00:39:29,199
If you need a biopsy, get it done.

747
00:39:30,320 --> 00:39:32,360
If you don't have time for Beijing, go to Xiamen first.

748
00:39:32,599 --> 00:39:34,599
Want me to contact a hospital for you first?

749
00:39:35,159 --> 00:39:36,000
Hello, Mr. Zhang.

750
00:39:36,280 --> 00:39:37,199
Hello, Mr. Zhang.

751
00:39:38,519 --> 00:39:38,960
Xiao Zhou.

752
00:39:39,599 --> 00:39:40,079
Xiao Zhou.

753
00:39:40,880 --> 00:39:41,239
Mr. Zhang.

754
00:39:41,239 --> 00:39:42,960
All the revision notes are attached.

755
00:39:43,119 --> 00:39:44,920
Have the outsourced firm fix it ASAP.

756
00:39:45,639 --> 00:39:46,119
By the way,

757
00:39:46,400 --> 00:39:48,039
can they deliver the final version before the day ends?

758
00:39:49,000 --> 00:39:50,480
They said the maintenance vehicle will be late.

759
00:39:50,599 --> 00:39:51,719
They just called.

760
00:39:51,719 --> 00:39:52,840
There was an accident on the road,

761
00:39:53,000 --> 00:39:53,599
and it's completely jammed.

762
00:39:53,719 --> 00:39:55,360
We don't have time to sit around and wait!

763
00:39:55,360 --> 00:39:56,920
Here's what you do: take a cab over there.

764
00:39:57,360 --> 00:39:58,280
Keep a close eye on the items.

765
00:39:59,320 --> 00:39:59,880
Understood.

766
00:41:06,400 --> 00:41:07,440
Writing at a desk for so long,

767
00:41:08,039 --> 00:41:09,079
the curve of your neck...

768
00:41:09,360 --> 00:41:10,400
really isn't looking good.

769
00:41:15,199 --> 00:41:15,920
What are you doing?

770
00:41:17,199 --> 00:41:19,039
My neck is bad too. I come often.

771
00:41:19,440 --> 00:41:20,199
Today was just a coincidence.

772
00:41:20,480 --> 00:41:22,559
Want me to introduce a good Chinese medicine doctor?

773
00:41:22,679 --> 00:41:23,559
One who does bone-setting.

774
00:41:23,960 --> 00:41:25,039
Polyps can be treated, too.

775
00:41:26,559 --> 00:41:27,559
What do you mean?

776
00:41:29,360 --> 00:41:32,360
If your husband needs checkups in Beijing,

777
00:41:32,360 --> 00:41:34,039
specialist appointments at Union Hospital or 301...

778
00:41:34,119 --> 00:41:35,320
I can arrange them for you.

779
00:41:38,719 --> 00:41:39,679
How do you know that?

780
00:41:39,960 --> 00:41:41,599
You're wiretapping our phones.

781
00:41:43,880 --> 00:41:45,400
What do you really want?

782
00:41:45,440 --> 00:41:47,159
Just academic exchange, that's all.

783
00:41:47,559 --> 00:41:49,280
I still want to hire you as a consultant.

784
00:41:49,440 --> 00:41:51,239
You name the price.

785
00:41:55,760 --> 00:41:57,360
Aren't you afraid I'll call the police?

786
00:42:05,719 --> 00:42:08,039
You and your husband work in the public sector.

787
00:42:08,400 --> 00:42:10,119
Neither of you wants to be linked to espionage.

788
00:42:10,880 --> 00:42:12,280
If you really call the police,

789
00:42:12,800 --> 00:42:14,199
you'll be the ones facing bigger trouble.

790
00:42:14,679 --> 00:42:15,800
No rush to decide.

791
00:42:16,559 --> 00:42:17,800
If you haven't made up your mind,

792
00:42:18,199 --> 00:42:19,199
think it over.

793
00:42:21,400 --> 00:42:22,360
We'll be in touch.

794
00:42:44,920 --> 00:42:45,519
Xiao Zhou,

795
00:42:46,159 --> 00:42:48,119
go get me a pack of cigarettes,

796
00:42:48,119 --> 00:42:49,320
and a lighter too.

797
00:43:08,360 --> 00:43:09,159
I'm Oho Ou,

798
00:43:09,159 --> 00:43:10,760
inviting you to watch the TV drama

799
00:43:10,760 --> 00:43:11,679
"Confrontation."

800
00:43:11,800 --> 00:43:12,840
Are you Huang Ziyan?

801
00:43:12,840 --> 00:43:14,199
I'm officially notifying you

802
00:43:14,199 --> 00:43:15,639
not to call him anymore.

803
00:43:15,639 --> 00:43:17,119
It's over between you two.

804
00:43:18,960 --> 00:43:19,760
I'm calling to report

805
00:43:19,760 --> 00:43:20,639
someone using drugs.

806
00:43:20,639 --> 00:43:21,000
Don't move!

807
00:43:21,719 --> 00:43:23,119
What are you doing?

808
00:43:23,119 --> 00:43:24,239
His trunk, behind the seats—

809
00:43:24,239 --> 00:43:25,039
search everywhere thoroughly.

810
00:43:25,280 --> 00:43:27,039
Xiao Zhou's situation is tricky,

811
00:43:27,039 --> 00:43:28,639
but there's still a way.

812
00:43:28,639 --> 00:43:30,000
I can also make your

813
00:43:30,000 --> 00:43:31,679
grandson's unwed mother

814
00:43:31,679 --> 00:43:32,880
leave the mainland forever.

815
00:43:33,239 --> 00:43:33,840
Professor Pan,

816
00:43:34,480 --> 00:43:36,000
this advisor position you mentioned,

817
00:43:36,000 --> 00:43:37,119
what would I actually be doing?
